    rdfs:comment "Running a workout delivered by a subscribed read-only Feed must never mutate the upstream Seed Note. Instead, `prepareJournalSessionRun` snapshots the Note verbatim into today's private `notebook/journal`, attaches the recorded Session and inline result widget to the clone, and stamps live Note Provenance pointing back to the upstream Note." ;
    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/RUN-02/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/RUN-02/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/RUN-02/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/RUN-02/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/RUN-02/beat/Prove> .

